siren: Starting calibration tests\:
label last
set {done} = true
siren: Do you see that pile of metal behind you? Pick up as many as you can, and bring them over to me.
[signal arg="calibrate_magnet"]
[end_timeline]
label overpowered (overpowered)
green: I feel really hot for some reason...
siren: Turn your magnets off now!
[wait time="3.0"]
siren: That happened so fast! Your limits are really low.
siren: We need to shut you down for repairs.
[signal arg="overheat"]
green: We.. need... what?
[end_timeline]